# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Private key material and local state. NEVER commit these.
#
# identity.json holds your Ed25519 seed and X25519 private key. Anyone with
# that file can impersonate you on the network. known_peers.json reveals who
# you have trusted. Current chat stays memory-only; history/ is retained here
# only to exclude legacy transcript files from older beta builds.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
identity.json
known_peers.json
history/
*-data/
bob-data/

